;. /format_ingestion_flow
  ;@ /flow/definition format_ingestion
  ;= Bring external data into a working document tree

    This deterministic example selects the existing Markdown parser, literal
    text view or native JSON decoder from each source's declared format. It
    never infers a schema from prose or asks a model to invent data. The catalogue
    supplies a small JSON sample. Rebind sources to actual filesystem captures
    using Declared authoring actions, Bind filesystem evidence, and explicit
    source format json, md or text.

    The decoded step keeps each JSON document as one native data value beside
    its exact source envelope. Objects retain ordered members and duplicates;
    null differs from an absent field, and number lexemes are not floating-point
    arithmetic. The native decoder has a documented permissive numeric dialect;
    this is not strict RFC validation, a domain schema, CSV or an OSM importer.

    Attach using the Nenex writer and a fresh destination, with no provider.
    The result's reference records retain the cohesive data value and original
    source beside their document projection. Both the decoded step and final
    result can feed another flow. The writer does not turn
    every JSON key into a slot or independently owned namespace child. A later
    domain adapter can consume the same decoded source cards deliberately.

    ;@ /flow/input sources
    ;= Named captured sources with an explicit format

    ;@ /flow/step decoded ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/library/decode_sources
    ;@ /flow/bind sources sources
    ;= Decode without flattening away value boundaries or provenance

    ;@ /flow/step pages ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/library/project_sources
    ;@ /flow/bind pages document
    ;@ /flow/bind sources decoded
    ;= Project a readable document tree from the decoded data

    ;@ /flow/result pages
    ;= Guarded deterministic publication

    ;@ /flow/page /
    ;@ /flow/uses data
    ;= Imported source workspace
      The reference children show the selected source formats and provenance.
      Inspect the decoded step to use cohesive native JSON values in another
      calculation or child flow. This document is a view of the import, not an
      editable database or an assertion that its data is true. Unsupported formats,
      malformed input and trailing content refuse before document publication.
